{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15104190","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1510419001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">아반드 영주님</style>께서 여러분을 만나시겠다고 하셨습니다.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>阿邦德领主</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D3F78D9DEF7B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510419002:0":{"text":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","source_cn":"你们已经亲眼见到呼临城的现状，有何感觉？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED90C16CF6228F35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","female":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"178726","variant_female_record_index":"178727","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1510419002":{"text":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","source_cn":"你们已经亲眼见到呼临城的现状，有何感觉？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED90C16CF6228F35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","female":"보칼리스의 상황을 직접 보셨는데, 어떠셨습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"178726","variant_female_record_index":"178727","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510419003:0":{"text":"그렇습니다.","source_cn":"没错。<key:dialog52>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CFC6D1B0ABA9D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇습니다.","female":"그렇습니다.","variant_male_record_index":"178728","variant_female_record_index":"178729","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510419006:0":{"text":"보칼리스에는 살아남을 길이 절실합니다.","source_cn":"呼临城需要一条活路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6AA1BCE5FE4F0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510419007:0":{"text":"전쟁은 일단 시작되면 돌이킬 수 없는 막다른 길이라, 양쪽 모두 의미 없는 피를 흘리게 할 뿐입니다.","source_cn":"战争是一条踏上就无法回头的绝路，只会让双方无谓流血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1AC19F4FE8217D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510419008:0":{"text":"만약 다른 방법이 있다면, 전 아쿠보르와 전면전을 피하기 위해 최선을 다할 겁니다.","source_cn":"如果有别的路可选，我会尽力避免和雅库伯尔全面开战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32558A1BD602B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510419009:0":{"text":"그러니 여러분께서도 마법으로 저주를 풀고, 보칼리스를 구하겠다는 약속을 꼭 지켜주시길 바랍니다.","source_cn":"希望你们也能实现自己的承诺：用魔法解除诅咒，拯救呼临城。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21843B0026ED2A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510419010:0":{"text":"음... 그 미역 같은 머리가 장식은 아닌가 보네.","source_cn":"嗯……看来你脖子上那颗海藻脑袋不是摆设。有点见地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C5BEB6E0C1D94C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510419011:1":{"text":"시끄럽게 떠들기만 하는 부관보단 훨씬 나아.","source_cn":"比那个只会嚷嚷的副将强多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DE7EC48C632E84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510419012:0":{"text":"...영주님을 뵈면 되도록 말을 아껴주시기 바랍니다.","source_cn":"……面见领主时，你不要说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF8D4083B9CEBE06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510419013:1":{"text":"그래. 어차피 나도 말하기 귀찮거든.","source_cn":"好啊，我懒得动嘴皮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77093D5FF8EDF370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510419014:1":{"text":"마법으로 아직 피어나지 않은 전쟁의 싹을 미리 제거할 수 있도록, 최선을 다해 설득할게요.","source_cn":"我们会尽力说服阿邦德，用魔法消弭未起的战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x188D93EFB7A633F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510419015:0":{"text":"보칼리스를 위해, 아쿠보르의 생명을 위해... 힘을 합치도록 해요, 페르세우스.","source_cn":"为了呼临城，也为了雅库伯尔的生灵……让我们共同努力吧，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84EF02BA42FF98DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510419016:0":{"text":"네.","source_cn":"嗯。<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E1683FF379D3E73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_m